{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get a taste of the fun with the free demo for <i>Purrplate</i>!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of proprietor and lay the foundation for your very own picnic restaurant. The demo includes the complete tutorial and the first stage, where you'll learn core mechanics like optimizing your layout and serving your adorable customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056210/extras/36a6d033bb700f46e5e77d4f99cfd91d.avif?t=1759115205\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can recruit 23 unique feline staff members, each with their own skills, to form your founding team. Notably, one of these cats comes with a dedicated storyline for you to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056210/extras/67e4373881ea831b27560c65b6d362b3.avif?t=1759115205\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our plan is to keep the demo updated alongside the game's development, allowing you to grow with the experience. Begin your heartwarming journey of management and companionship today at the <strong>purrplate</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056210?t=1759115205","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056210?t=1759115205","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056210/50fb874fc78d3c9c6e23f62dcaf4ab459d858142/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759115205","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056210/50fb874fc78d3c9c6e23f62dcaf4ab459d858142/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759115205","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get a taste of the fun with the free demo for <i>Purrplate</i>!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of proprietor and lay the foundation for your very own picnic restaurant. The demo includes the complete tutorial and the first stage, where you'll learn core mechanics like optimizing your layout and serving your adorable customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056210/extras/36a6d033bb700f46e5e77d4f99cfd91d.avif?t=1759115205\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can recruit 23 unique feline staff members, each with their own skills, to form your founding team. Notably, one of these cats comes with a dedicated storyline for you to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056210/extras/67e4373881ea831b27560c65b6d362b3.avif?t=1759115205\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our plan is to keep the demo updated alongside the game's development, allowing you to grow with the experience. Begin your heartwarming journey of management and companionship today at the <strong>purrplate</strong>!</p>","developers":["LeankomGames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3676490","name":"PurrPlate"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056210/e6205dce5f87e5d817c2356dfe07d8ecef46da5f/header.jpg?t=1759115205","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Developed by Leankom Games. Published by Aurakenn Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirem